{"4597320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Journey to Shorestone", "steam_appid": 4597320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The council of Boggs awaits your command. Across forgotten marshes, windswept shores, and ancient stone, long-dormant beings stir once more. Welcome these creatures to Finlay's castle, cultivate thriving gardens, and awaken the spirit of the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4597320/extras/73b5075b34c81aa3691b42362c6cbba0.poster.avif?t=1786477105\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4597320/extras/73b5075b34c81aa3691b42362c6cbba0.webm?t=1786477105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4597320/extras/73b5075b34c81aa3691b42362c6cbba0.mp4?t=1786477105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build from moss, sand, and stone </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sculpt your own realm from moss, sand, and stone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse biomes provide unique habitats for creatures. Shape a rich environment of shifting sands, wild swamps, and ancient ruins.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cultivate thriving gardens  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow gardens of different types and uncover landmarks where creatures thrive. Each biome you create unlocks new materials, developments, and regional wonders. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build rivers, paths, and connect your settlements across the wilderness. Cultivate a realm where wilderness and settlements grow side by side.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4597320/extras/8e696a46092a040b87d70915eb87bb05.poster.avif?t=1786477105\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4597320/extras/8e696a46092a040b87d70915eb87bb05.webm?t=1786477105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4597320/extras/8e696a46092a040b87d70915eb87bb05.mp4?t=1786477105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The council of Boggs awaits your command. Across forgotten marshes, windswept shores, and ancient stone, long-dormant beings stir once more. Welcome these creatures to Finlay's castle, cultivate thriving gardens, and awaken the spirit of the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4597320/extras/73b5075b34c81aa3691b42362c6cbba0.poster.avif?t=1786477105\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4597320/extras/73b5075b34c81aa3691b42362c6cbba0.webm?t=1786477105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4597320/extras/73b5075b34c81aa3691b42362c6cbba0.mp4?t=1786477105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build from moss, sand, and stone </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sculpt your own realm from moss, sand, and stone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse biomes provide unique habitats for creatures. Shape a rich environment of shifting sands, wild swamps, and ancient ruins.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cultivate thriving gardens  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow gardens of different types and uncover landmarks where creatures thrive. Each biome you create unlocks new materials, developments, and regional wonders. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build rivers, paths, and connect your settlements across the wilderness. Cultivate a realm where wilderness and settlements grow side by side.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4597320/extras/8e696a46092a040b87d70915eb87bb05.poster.avif?t=1786477105\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4597320/extras/8e696a46092a040b87d70915eb87bb05.webm?t=1786477105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4597320/extras/8e696a46092a040b87d70915eb87bb05.mp4?t=1786477105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Shape a rich environment of shifting sands, wild swamps, and ancient ruins. Each biome you create unlocks new creatures, materials, and landmarks. Place gardens, rivers, paths, and connect your settlements across the wilderness. Forge a living world for you and your creature neighbors to call home.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4597320/4deb0f2eb1c51db56bf7cafd4a60badf0a755dd6/header.jpg?t=1786477105", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4597320/b9c3e3c66792f5aa2708f9c2c13615eae54c4285/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786477105", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4597320/b9c3e3c66792f5aa2708f9